# ==============================================================================
# LEOPOLD MUGISHA PORTFOLIO - ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions: Copy this file to .env.local and populate the keys below.
# All keys remain strictly on the server-side and are NEVER exposed to the client.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. AI ASSISTANT PROVIDER (Optional but recommended)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Gemini API Key (Recommended for fast streaming and grounded responses)
# Get a key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# OpenAI / OpenRouter / Groq API Key (Alternative AI provider)
# Get a key at: https://platform.openai.com/
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Note: If no AI key is configured, the assistant automatically runs in
# "Verified Knowledge Engine" mode, using Leopold's structured knowledge base
# without hallucinating or breaking.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. CONTACT EMAIL PROVIDER (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Resend API Key for direct inbox delivery from the contact form
# Get a key at: https://resend.com/
RESEND_API_KEY=your_resend_api_key_here
